## GET /api/option-trades/multi-leg/{id}/legs

Multi-Leg Trade Legs

Returns the individual option legs that make up a single multi-leg strategy, aggregated by contract with
size-weighted greeks and prices. Pass the strategy `id` returned by the Multi-Leg Option Trades feed.


### Fully resolved operation
```json
